  "description": "Jo Hyeong-jun, a boy once called the future of Korean short track. After a year of explosive growth, the records that had once soared above the sky hit rock bottom. Just as he was on the verge of being driven out and forced to quit—\n\nBefore him appeared a boy with the same name, the rising monster of the hockey world: Ryu Hyeong-jun.\n\n\"Let's play ice hockey, Jo Hyeong-jun. Your stage is over here.\"\n\n*Source: Naver Comic, translated*",
